@startuml
!include _style.iuml
!pragma layout smetana
left to right direction
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #1F618D
  FontColor #1B2631
}
skinparam arrow {
  Color #1F618D
  FontSize 12
}
title Payment model: the buying company pays, vendors never pay

rectangle "**Buying company**\n(the tenant)" as B #F9E79F
rectangle "**Vendors**\n(invited to tenders)" as V #E5E7E9
rectangle "**WaslaBid**\nabout SAR 30,000\nper tenant a year" as U #82E0AA
rectangle "**Partners**\nOdoo, SAP B1, audit firms" as P #D7BDE2
rectangle "**Pass-through costs**\nWathq SAR 9-12 per check\nAI USD 1-3 per tender\ngateway about 2 % + SAR 1" as C #F5B7B1

B --> U : subscription per tenant\nannual invoice, bank transfer\n(2 months free) or monthly card/mada
B --> U : add-ons per use
V ..> U : free: register and submit
U --> P : 20 % of year-1 revenue\nfor a referred customer
U --> C : cost per use

legend bottom
|= Tier |= SAR a month |= Open tenders |= Users |= Adds |
|<#FCF3CF> Starter | 1,500 | 2 | 10 | Branded portal, sealed envelopes, audit log |
|<#FAD7A0> Growth | 3,500 | 6 | 30 | Custom domain, approval chain, SSO, no "powered by" |
|<#F8C471> Pro | 7,500 | Unlimited | Unlimited | PO export, priority support, AI review |
....
|= Add-on |= Charged |= Price |
| Vendor CR check (Wathq) | per check | SAR 15 |
| PO e-signature | per signed PO | SAR 10 |
| AI offer review (Starter, Growth) | per tender | SAR 150 |
| ERP export connection | one-time | SAR 15,000 to 40,000 |
....
First tender free on every tier. Prices exclude 15 % VAT. Flat price per company, not per user.
endlegend
@enduml
